===Usage notes===
Note that the pronunciation differs depending on register, which also happens for the antonym “[[yesterday]]” and the coordinate term “[[today]]”. Corresponding in formality to ''ashita'', ''asu'', and ''myōnichi'' for “tomorrow” are {{m|ja|昨日|tr=kinō}}, {{m|ja|昨日|tr=kiso|pos=rare}}, and {{m|ja|昨日|tr=sakujitsu}} for “yesterday”; and {{m|ja|きょう|tr=kyō}}, {{m|ja|今日|tr=konnichi}}, and {{m|ja|本日|tr=honjitsu}} for “today”.

